# Kylox, Visionary Inventor: only an instant or sorcery card may be cast from among the exiled cards. Two Memnites are sacrificed
# and the top two cards, a Grizzly Bears and a Lightning Bolt, are exiled. The Bears (a creature spell) may not be chosen even
# though it could not be cast for nothing in any other way; the Bolt (the positive control) is cast at Bot2. The Bears stay in exile.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Kylox, Visionary Inventor
Memnite
Memnite
Plains
Grizzly Bears
Lightning Bolt
Plains x5

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x10

[Actions]
[T1 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Kylox, Visionary Inventor.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T1 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Kylox, Visionary Inventor > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Memnite; Memnite)
? Exile.Count = 2
! Bot1.Choose(Grizzly Bears)
Bot1.Choose(Lightning Bolt)
Bot1.Target(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T1 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 13
Exile = Grizzly Bears
Exile.Count = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 2
